            "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:04:34.033353+00:00",
            "notes": "If you didn't get [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) last round then get it this round. This power is amazing combined with [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) especially if you struggle with hitting sleeps\n\nOtherwise:\n\nTake [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc) if you're confident in your ability to hit crits, if not then get whatever you want. As I said, the powers in this build change depending on the match...\n\nSometimes I take [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) if I need to heal faster \nSometimes I take [Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7) if I need more survivability \n\n[Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) is a must in most ana builds because it's such an op item, have quick reaction time and no dps is a problem for you especially tracer\n[Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) is also a must-have\n\nremember to just play smart and manage your cooldowns right, even though we have [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) don't just go throwing your sleep around without reason especially if there's dive dps\n\nif you have enough extra money then get [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28) as well\n\nif you cant afford [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) then just get somes green in place of it",
