            "notes": "If you can't afford [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) then get [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and catch up next round.\n\nThe power are completely optional now but I enjoy the nano stuff so it's what I choose, but honestly changing the powers for this build doesn't change anything so get what you want, but just make note that there isn't much [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) in this build so [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735) won't be that good nor do i take [Tactical Rifle](item_683d8145-a13e-4ea8-997b-0ed2151b1cac) because its useless if you can aim\n\nIf you have extra money, just buy what you want.. the only stuff you need is what I have starred",
